Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2012年 美国经济崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失业率创新高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪率急剧上升 失去控制 监狱制度出现转折点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有监狱现被私有企业以牟利为目的开办
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终端岛监狱举行一系列死亡竞赛 并在网上直播
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯被迫进行生死格斗 节目创下高收视率
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:01:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们成为新一批角斗士而终端岛则成为了他们的竞技场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但正如古罗马的暴民一样 观众很快对节目感到厌倦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们追求更残酷的刺激 死亡飞车也因此诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尾部装甲怎样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rear armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好后撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better drop back...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一圈了 我们能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the last lap. We can win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:31.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这混球为什么不去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't this son of a bitch just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我用凝固汽油弹!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the napalm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都用不了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing works!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把墓碑卸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the tombstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我指示 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my mark. Three,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 追上你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you now, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要这样玩吗?那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you want to do it? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在紧追着 我们的油缸爆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still coming. Our tank is exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他追上我们了 你得后撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got us, Frank. You have to drop back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有四分之一英里就到终点了 我能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a quarter mile to the line. I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sayonara, Frankie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《死亡飞车》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,40年了 比我的婚龄还长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty years. Longer than my marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好像你会惦记这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you're gonna miss this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:06:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难相信这里会倒闭 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still can't believe they closed it down. Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只会惦记我的薪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing I'm gonna miss is my paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是老实人干的老实活啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was honest work for honest men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一家人要养 在外边又找不到工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a family to feed, and there's no work out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说码头那边招人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear they might be hiring down at the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像要招五个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five men, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哥儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿上你们的薪水尾款 然后离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collect your final paycheck and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大门会在15分钟内锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The main gate will be locked in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙儿 准备被大宰一顿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to be ripped off, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿上你们的薪水 有秩序地离开工地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collect your paycheck and leave the premises in an orderly manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大门会在15分钟内锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The main gate will be locked in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现金还是支票?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cash or check?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好给现金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better make it cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,300块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$300.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上两个星期我工作了120个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked 120 hours the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现金手续费 下一个! 现金手续费?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cash fee. Next! Cash fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要现金的话 要收手续费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted cash, there's a fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要支票了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a check instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着这家公司倒闭 我才不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing as the company's out of business, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不满意 那边有投诉信箱 下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like it, there's the complaint box. Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们永远不会明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就预到有这一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Self-fulfilling prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是老实人 跟你们一样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're honest workers. We're just like you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群混账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的 妈的! 罗斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Shit! Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 罗斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塑胶子弹 那群混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rubber bullets, the assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 对不起 那么迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Sorry I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作愉快吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice day at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把衬衣给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们叫来防暴警察 情况很恶劣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called the riot police. It got ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我配不上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't deserve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰森·艾姆斯 你是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good man, Jensen Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我 别人怎么看你都不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it doesn't matter what anyone else thinks but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 300块 他们就给了我这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, $300. That's all they gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能撑下去的 我们一直都能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make it last. We always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天开始找工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll start looking tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你忘记了我嫁给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're forgetting that I married you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为的不是钱啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your non-financial assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸回家了 声音是你发出的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's home. Is it you who was making all that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.49,0:10:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小派帕想要什么 要听故事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does little Piper want? Want a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你不会明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you won't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可以好好练习 那很好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it will be good practice for me. But it will be good practice for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们疯狂一回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闻起来味道不错哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something smelIs good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上 趴在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the ground! Stay on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把刀放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别反抗 趴在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not resist! Stay on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在原地!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠着墙边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己擦身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scrub yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.63,0:15:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner will step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:04.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们滑倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们滑倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狱长 早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是场里最翘的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There goes the baddest ass in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥儿 你像是爱上她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound like you're in love, homie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的 我起来就为了吃这个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. I had to wake up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的幻觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, is it my imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是这狗屎越来越烂了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or is this shit getting worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这坨 到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, what is this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.27,0:17:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燕麦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥儿 你怎么吃得消燕麦片?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, how do you fuck up oatmeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个新来的是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the new guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰森·艾姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jensen Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个车手?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没听说过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我数年前看过他赛车 他车技很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I saw him race years ago. He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来搬去了州北地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did some time upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也因此毁了他的职业生涯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed his career.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威拉德赛 联盟赛和巴特勒赛的 最快圈速保持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holder of the fastest laps at Willard, Union and Butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他在赛道下跟在赛道上一样快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope he's as fast off the track as he is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日子从不平淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never a dull day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 是派晨高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up. It's Pachenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是那个杀妻凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're the wife killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死一个女人需要莫大的勇气啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takes a big man to kill a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你也强奸幼童吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you rape kiddies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀女人 强奸幼童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy kilIs women. Rapes kiddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得我们该怎么处理这事情?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think we ought to do about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上 趴在地上 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down on the ground! Down on the ground! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜他也不喜欢燕麦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he didn't like the oatmeal, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你麻烦惹大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've got stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把一个兄弟会的头头打伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting the hurt on a Brotherhood general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在 麻烦还在后头呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But right now, that's the least of your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟车手有关的人 狱长都不会对他们客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warden does bad things to people that mix it up with the drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:20:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯77119 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner 77119, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 里奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Ulrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座监狱是杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This prison is the home to murderers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强奸犯和各种暴力罪犯的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rapists and violent offenders of every kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:16.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国刑罚体制把人渣中的人渣交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The United States penal system sends me the worst of the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你刚才惹怒的那个人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the men you've provoked...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样说吧 艾姆斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's just say, Mr. Ames,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里的小命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the life term you joined us for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许比你想象中要短得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may be a lot shorter than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 惯例啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand. Tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令新人受挫 所有人都享受过这种爽逼好时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soften up the new guy. An ass-slapping good time had by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foul language is an issue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏话是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查看你的记录时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While looking over your record,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:21:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不禁留意了你的工作经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't help noticing your occupational history.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你有点赛车才华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems you have some talent behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出于好奇问问 你最后一次赛车是几时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of curiosity, when was the last time you raced?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一段时间了 我驾照没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while. I lost my license.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能帮你怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I could help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把驾照搞回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my license back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我脑子想的是另一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had something else in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道死亡飞车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're familiar with the Death Race
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那个叫弗兰克斯坦的车手吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the driver the fans call Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个因撞车而面容全毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man so disfigured by crashes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以致他被迫戴上面具的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he's forced to wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们热切期待他能重回赛道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His return to the track is highly anticipated,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.14,0:21:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这就是我的问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and therein lies my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有人知道 可怜的弗兰克已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knows yet, but poor Frank died
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在最后一场比赛过后不久 他死于手术台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on an operating table not long after his last race.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都可以戴上面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone can wear the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.69,0:21:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是谁都能开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not just anyone can drive the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你车技精湛我要求你把传奇延续下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the skilIs I require to keep the legend alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你成为弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to become Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.37,0:22:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不把真相说出来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just tell the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众想再次看到弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The audience wants to see Frank again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他令他们感动 他鼓舞了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He moves them. Inspires them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个世界里 这样的人不是那么容易找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in this world, that's not so easy to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么让你认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think for a second
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会赌命为你做这事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would risk my life doing this for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢过五场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win five races,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.41,0:22:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克已经赢了四场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Frank has won four.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:50.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再赢一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win one more,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.55,0:22:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管这叫直觉吧 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it intuition, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你不属于这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you belong in here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.59,0:23:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟那帮禽兽待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the rest of these animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕我会让你失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛周五举行 我要你做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race is Friday, and I need your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10秒钟后 我会收回这个提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds from now, I will retract this offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它转给囚犯68815 詹姆斯·弗朗西斯·巴里尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and extend it to Prisoner 68815, James Francis Barlini,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他水平没你那么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who, clearly not of your caliber,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.21,0:23:38.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他对此必定满腔热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be quite enthusiastic about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你 就很不幸要独自度过的你监狱生涯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, unfortunately, will need to spend your incarceration in solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在起我知道你的肮脏小秘密了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since now I know your dirty little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定你宁愿单独监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you'll find solitary preferable
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.39,0:23:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想派晨高先生和他的朋友们 会怎么对付你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to what Mr. Pachenko and his friends have in mind for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是位技术精湛的车手 你机会很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a skilled driver. Your chances are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃姆斯先生 我是在还你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm offering you your freedom, Mr. Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这都不值得赌命 还有什么值得?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's not worth risking your life for, what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 把她升起 把线缝紧 她内出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, turn her up and tighten the lines! She's hemorrhaging!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必叫我"夫人" 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to call me "ma'am." You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是埃姆斯先生 你知道他为何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Ames. You know why he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离比赛还不到一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race is less than a week away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.36,0:24:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你充满信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have great confidence in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.09,0:24:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我走了 你们两个互相熟悉一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, I'll leave you two to get acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.00,0:24:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰森·格纳·艾姆斯 24岁搬到美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jensen Garner Ames. Moved to the States at 24 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字源于"杰森拦截机"这款车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Named after a car, the Jensen Interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.07,0:25:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三次获得本地跑道赛冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A three-time local speedway champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.61,0:25:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你做足功课了 还是因为你无所不知?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done your homework. Or do you just know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.01,0:25:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰森拦截机 我有一台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jensen Interceptor. I had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开起来像台校巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handled like a school bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.65,0:25:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管我叫教练 大家都这么叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me Coach. Everyone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.52,0:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮手和管事婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner. Lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.99,0:25:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带你周围看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.33,0:25:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有个功能完善的车间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a fully functioning auto shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟监狱外的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like you'd find in the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.67,0:25:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每支车队都有各自的车间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each team has their own shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们河水不犯井水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't help them. They don't help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那些囚犯面前 你是杰森·艾姆斯 新来的油猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the inmates, you're Jensen Ames, the new grease monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了车队中的我们和一部分狱警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody will know you're Frank except us on the team
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.18,0:25:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会知道你是弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a handful of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody will talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎能那么肯定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗 她是这里的审判官 陪审员和执行官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey. In here, she is judge, jury and executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.66,0:25:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车赛是她的心肝宝贝 她会干掉任何威胁到车赛的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race is her baby. Anyone who threatens it, she kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.59,0:25:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克离开赛道后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The audience for the race has halved
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众的数量已经减半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since Frank's been out of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:25:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司的利润也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so has the corporation's profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.73,0:26:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是她需要你的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面的是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗把狱里一整个联隔离了一个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey's had a whole wing of the prison in isolation for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.21,0:26:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要他们为某种东西埋头苦干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.65,0:26:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候见见这头怪物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to meet the Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.82,0:26:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野马V8长顶赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustang V8 Fastback.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取自最好 把它改得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took the best and made it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是台5.4升鲁斯V8引擎 装有福特竞赛超级增压器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a V8 Roush 5.4 liter with a Ford Racing supercharger
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.10,0:26:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能爆发出850匹马力和接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}putting out 850 horsepower and close to...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,700磅扭力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven hundred pounds of torque
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,配有连续多缸喷油系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with sequential multi-port fuel injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貌似还有一套250匹马力的 氮气装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like there's a 250 hp NOS unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.41,0:26:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.61,0:26:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着是我们乐于为你 度身定做的保护套件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we had some fun customizing your personal protection package.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.65,0:26:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前部和侧部是0.75英寸厚的钢板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-quarter inch steel plate, front and sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:27:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 这里和那里是防弹玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bulletproof glass will be here, here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.43,0:27:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后部是6英寸厚的实心护甲 我们称它为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the rear, a six-inch solid steel shield we call
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.13,0:27:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墓碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"the tombstone."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.94,0:27:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防御用的滑油 烟雾和凝固汽油弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oil, smoke, and napalm for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.24,0:27:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击用的双30毫米口径弹药带式机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And twin 30-millimeter belt-fed machine guns for offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.85,0:27:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹药呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where's the ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.58,0:27:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车赛当天才有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get that on race day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.69,0:27:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 每个人第一次看到它都这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Everyone thinks that, first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.92,0:27:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么想?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinks what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.16,0:27:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想把枪对着狱警 想逃狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About turning the guns on the guards, about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.63,0:27:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不是在想这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I wasn't thinking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴 因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm glad, because
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.66,0:27:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗在所有车的枪里都装上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey has got electric kill switches
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.37,0:27:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电击开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all the guns in all the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.30,0:27:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有瞭望塔都全副武装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all the guard towers are fortified,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.94,0:27:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的枪比你的还要猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their guns are bigger than your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有提到那些直升机吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did I mention the helicopters,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我们正处于一座岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and also the fact that we're on an island here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离最近的海岸线有一英里远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a mile from the nearest shoreline?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里唯一的进出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way in or out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你进来时那条狭窄的桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is on that one skinny bridge you came in on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.83,0:28:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车最重要的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most important part of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克杀了多少人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people has Frank killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20 每场比赛的死亡率是62.2%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty. The mortality rate is average 62.2% per race.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.51,0:28:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么弗兰克四次战胜厄运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Frank beat the odds four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 直到他们打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Till they beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车赛分三场在三天里举行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race takes place in three stages over three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在头两场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first two stages,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须去干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just got to try and get rid of
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能多的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as much of the competition as you can
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.59,0:29:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时保住性命到达终点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while getting your own skinny ass over the line alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三场才比速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third stage is where speed counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁先到达终点谁赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First one over that line wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.83,0:29:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上你会见到你的领航员 凯斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow morning, you meet your navigator, Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.43,0:29:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会帮你引航路线 装载武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll help you navigate the course, reload your weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和车辆运行这方面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and help with the running of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.14,0:29:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想开赛之前跟她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to talk to her ahead of time, before the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊我也想有个大波妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'd like a big-tittie girl
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替我舔舔鞋子上的花生酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to lick peanut butter off my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.24,0:29:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.78,0:29:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥儿 这里毕竟是座监狱 她是条小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still a prison, man. She's a chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们从州北部的女子监狱坐狱车过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They get bussed in from the women's facility upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都关于收视率 飙车和美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all about ratings, fast cars, pretty women.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.12,0:29:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 大炮乔是唯一一个用 男领航员的车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Machine Gun Joe is the only one that has a male navigators.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.15,0:29:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他是个同性恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause he's gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.45,0:29:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上 他超车超得太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it's 'Cause he goes through them so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.19,0:29:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连观众都看得头晕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the audience gets squeamish.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 他超他们车 超他们的屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he goes through them. Through their ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.70,0:29:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每杀一个人 他都在这里割一刀留所纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cuts each kill into his skin as a souvenir, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.73,0:29:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他车手呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the rest of the drivers?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:29:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管事婆?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lists?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.07,0:30:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,14K\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.31,0:30:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一代美籍华人 第十代三合会会员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First generation Chinese-American, 10th generation Triad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.48,0:30:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他父亲送他上商学院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his father sent him to business school.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.23,0:30:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是这里唯一一个 拿到麻省理工学位的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only man in here who holds a degree from MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.67,0:30:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在赛道外杀了四个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's killed four men off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.20,0:30:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在赛道上杀了七个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another seven on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.94,0:30:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神 赫特·格林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hector Grimm, The Grimm Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.27,0:30:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是位大师 心理变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man's a master. Clinical psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他相信轩尼诗是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believes that Hennessey is an avatar
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,印度死神迦梨的化身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Hindu goddess of death, Kali,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.95,0:30:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他就是她的使徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that he is her messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.55,0:30:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞越疯人院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuckoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被判三倍终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three time consecutive life sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.25,0:30:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在赛道外杀了6个人 赛道上杀了12个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's killed six men off the track, another 12 on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.46,0:30:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经见过兄弟会的本地分部了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've already met the local chapter of the Brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.44,0:30:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的车手 派晨高 在赛道上杀了9个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their driver, Pachenko, has killed nine men on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.81,0:30:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道他在赛道外杀了多少个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows how many off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.72,0:30:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔维斯·柯尔特 本地巨星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis Colt, our local superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.65,0:30:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当过全美汽车比赛协会车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Used to race for NASCAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.89,0:30:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 他也很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he was good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.06,0:30:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到他喝了一瓶苏格兰威士忌 和一把安眠酮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until he fell asleep behind the wheel of his Mercedes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.33,0:30:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他的大奔里睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the help of a bottle of scotch and a handful of ludes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把斯卡拉歌剧院的整个露台铲平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wiped out the entire patio of La Scala.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.93,0:30:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把12人送进医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sent a dozen people to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.63,0:31:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.17,0:31:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死了3个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It killed three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术上说 他是这里最好的车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically the best driver in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.40,0:31:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但内心却是一头禽兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a mean son of a bitch within.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.51,0:31:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娘儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.35,0:31:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说你们的弗兰克还在病床上 有十五处未愈合骨折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear your man Frank is still in the infirmary with 15 unhealed fractures.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.82,0:31:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还听说他不能参赛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also hear he's not gonna make the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.25,0:31:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到得可真多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.59,0:31:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这新来的是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the new fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,油猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grease monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊猴儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well. Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.33,0:31:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你改个新名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a new name for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.33,0:31:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丑八怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Igor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.17,0:31:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是狱里最臭的怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you about the ugliest motherfucker in this prison, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.14,0:31:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好笑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.35,0:31:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到弗兰克的时候告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell Frank when you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.92,0:31:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们之间的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This race is between me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.56,0:31:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次不再是进医院那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time won't be no infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次进的是太平间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把话传给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be sure to pass it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.97,0:32:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙儿 他真是个愤怒的同性恋啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, that is one angry homo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.95,0:32:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.65,0:32:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.55,0:32:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了获得行为分 在赛道上工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to work on the track for good behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.72,0:32:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是全球定位手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are GPS tracking bracelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.73,0:32:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防他们跳河逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case somebody decides to go for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.94,0:33:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.59,0:33:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是老弗兰克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the old Frank's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经跟他的手融为一体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It kind of melted to his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein! Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦! 弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein! Frankenstein! Frankenstein! Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.48,0:34:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他交给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.13,0:34:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟其他车手说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to the other drivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.63,0:34:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克从不说话 制造一种神秘感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank never did. Part of the mystique.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.27,0:34:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让面具替你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the mask do the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.55,0:35:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的小妞来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's our girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.68,0:36:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是凯斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.15,0:36:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.35,0:36:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣 听起来不像弗兰克啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny, you don't sound like Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别慌 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't sweat it. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.69,0:36:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟弗兰克一起比赛过 我会帮你看着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drove with Frank. I'll watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.56,0:36:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你帮我看得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than you watched his, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.93,0:36:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在这里 我得赶紧一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still here. Well, I guess I got to work a little harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.14,0:36:43.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back to your car, prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.35,0:36:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你知道怎样交朋友吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure know how to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯斯 这是反光玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Case. This is mirrored glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到里面的 你可以把面具脱下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can see in, so you might want to take the mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你喜欢戴着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you like it under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这么能戴着那玩意开车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did he drive in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.93,0:37:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.13,0:37:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比上个弗兰克好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're better looking than the last Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.57,0:37:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但撞过几次车就不同了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few crashes should change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挂档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3 2 1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们全球直播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're live worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.39,0:37:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看死亡飞车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.59,0:37:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终端岛监狱将举办为期三天的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terminal Island Penitentiary hosts three days
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽车终极大屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the ultimate in auto carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.49,0:37:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一场比赛将在10分钟内开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stage 1 of the race begins streaming live in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.53,0:37:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在订购第一场只需要99块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subscribe to Stage 1 now for $99,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.54,0:37:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订购全三场超低价只需250块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or subscribe to all three stages for the low price of $250.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.27,0:37:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,100多台实况镜头为你直播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access to over 100 live camera feeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.68,0:37:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零距离观看你最喜爱的车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch from the car of your favorite driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.21,0:37:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爱怎么看就怎么看 不经审查 不经剪辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the action your way, uncensored and unedited.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.05,0:38:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场全速死亡之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A full-on fight to the death,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为你带来四场赢家弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}featuring four-time winner Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.79,0:38:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三场赢家大炮乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-time winner Machine Gun Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.83,0:38:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派晨高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pachenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崔维斯·柯尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travis Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.53,0:38:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众大爱弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Audience favorite Frankenstein
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将延续他与大炮乔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}resumes his bitter grudge match
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.27,0:38:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怨恨仇杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Machine Gun Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.80,0:38:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缺席六个月后 弗兰克重新回到赛场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein returns to the track after a six-month absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.37,0:38:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众想念他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.41,0:38:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是个不死之躯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the man that just won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.25,0:38:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1200万观众只观看他的镜头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve million hits on his angle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.65,0:38:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还没发动引擎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't even started the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.78,0:38:35.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我们有4500万观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll do 45 million viewers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么被关进来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.93,0:38:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说我杀了一警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say I killed a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.10,0:38:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有杀吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.83,0:38:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏警察?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.00,0:38:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.57,0:38:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差劲的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lousy husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.24,0:39:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克 凯斯 听到我说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank, Case, you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.88,0:39:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.58,0:39:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这场比赛跑三圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a three-lap race.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗在第二圈才会激活武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey doesn't activate the weapons till lap two.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住先到先得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now remember, it's first come, first served,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以排前有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it pays to be out in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. Countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.01,0:40:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定他能做到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sure he can deliver?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左推进100英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jog left to 100 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,50 20...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50, 20...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.97,0:41:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.38,0:41:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加速 左路猛超!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punch it! Hard left up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.50,0:41:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他自己能应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to be handling himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.62,0:41:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wakey-wakey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.48,0:42:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被超了 你得追上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being passed. We've gotta catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.32,0:42:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我在干什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I know what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.09,0:42:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 就别管那混球...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, just leave that motherfucker...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.29,0:42:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what the hell I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.96,0:42:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.14,0:42:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能跟乔这样子并排走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go head-to-head with Joe like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.18,0:42:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会撞散你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll tear you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.92,0:43:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.15,0:43:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你害死我们之前 听他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to him, before you get us both killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.42,0:43:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯斯 帮他解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Case, help him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.72,0:43:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左边有条捷径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a shortcut to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.49,0:43:09.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.03,0:43:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在抄捷径!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking the shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.27,0:43:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我看不见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.45,0:43:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激活宝剑和护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate swords and shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.41,0:43:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝剑触发主要的枪弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The swords arm the main guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.41,0:43:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护盾触发凝固汽油弹 滑油和烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields trigger the napalm, oil and smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.55,0:43:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我以前看过这车赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I've seen this race before.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.65,0:43:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自以为是 需要整台车的重量才能触发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you know. It takes the weight of the entire car.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.69,0:43:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须四个轮子都同时碰到按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to make contact with all four tires simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.49,0:44:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么我不知道的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else I'm missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.66,0:44:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别要我多说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.97,0:44:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激活骷髅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate death heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.10,0:44:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骷髅激活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death heads activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.38,0:44:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽吧 宝贝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel it, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.07,0:45:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 死神又得一分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Score another one for the Reaper, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.31,0:45:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.41,0:45:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别客气 来吧 解除警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mention it. Come on. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.49,0:45:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操你妈的贱逼 我操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, puto! Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.22,0:45:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.87,0:45:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 滑油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out. Oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.02,0:45:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.12,0:45:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你老妈是个贱逼 混球!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother's a puta, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.89,0:45:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.56,0:46:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得返回比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get back in the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.02,0:46:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备飞弹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.50,0:46:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.82,0:46:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我叫什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.94,0:46:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫14K啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.62,0:46:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 我是他妈的死神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the fucking Reaper, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.55,0:46:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀不死我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.12,0:46:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以烧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can burn me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.69,0:47:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以射我 但就他妈的杀不死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can fucking shoot me, but you just can't motherfucking kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.52,0:47:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次比赛前把窗口擦干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that off my window when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.62,0:47:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 收视率直飙4600万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're streaming to 46 million viewers, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.01,0:47:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击武器准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Offensive weapons are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.21,0:47:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.02,0:47:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操 卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck. It's jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.92,0:47:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.98,0:48:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.19,0:48:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧 凯斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, Case!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.03,0:48:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.18,0:49:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.35,0:49:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有护盾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.19,0:49:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那狗娘养的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.99,0:49:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从柯尔特手上抢了护盾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just stole a shield from Colt!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.53,0:49:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防御武器启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defense weapons are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.57,0:49:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他尝尝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.20,0:49:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凝固汽油弹不能发射!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The napalm won't fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.54,0:49:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.91,0:49:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没烟雾 没滑油 没凝固汽油弹?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No smoke? No oil? No napalm?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.84,0:49:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又没有了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.59,0:49:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.86,0:49:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我吗 混球?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me, motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.17,0:50:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.54,0:50:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墓碑快承受不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tombstone won't take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克 凯斯 那些20口径子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank, Case, those 50 caliber shelIs will be through the tombstone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.91,0:50:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会瞬间射穿墓碑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a matter of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.11,0:50:12.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的建议是 要么输给他 要么干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My advice, either lose him or kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.82,0:50:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解下凝固汽油弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unhook the napalm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.30,0:50:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在我大腿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on my lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.43,0:50:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.50,0:50:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在我大腿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on my lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.79,0:50:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.16,0:50:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.19,0:50:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.95,0:51:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.11,0:51:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.57,0:51:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抄捷径 加速 我们能赢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shortcut. Punch it. We can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.79,0:52:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.94,0:52:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林 柯尔特和西亚德都丧生了 6位车手生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grimm, Colt and Siad are gone. Six remaining drivers alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.68,0:52:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就订购第二场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subscribe to Stage 2 now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.69,0:52:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生们 还有14个小时 我们开工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 14 hours, gentlemen, so let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.23,0:52:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.13,0:52:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯斯 发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened out there, Case?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.27,0:52:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他分心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.60,0:52:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他分心了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got distracted?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.91,0:53:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.15,0:53:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.32,0:53:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看 喷油器好好的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this. The oil sprayers work fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.09,0:53:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.50,0:53:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.25,0:53:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.99,0:53:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太烂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.99,0:53:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向好的方面看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.83,0:53:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们都喜欢看英雄回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone loves a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.20,0:53:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你的吗 艾姆斯先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do for you, Mr. Ames?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.34,0:53:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真幸运 一个像我这样的车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure are lucky a driver like me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.14,0:54:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰巧出现在你的监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just happened to turn up in your prison when I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.34,0:54:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅是幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm more than lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.14,0:54:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是被眷顾着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.98,0:54:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时就好像是上帝之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes it's like the right hand of God
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.91,0:54:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是放在我肩膀上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is sitting on my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.19,0:54:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天不参赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not racing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.69,0:54:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go fuck yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.62,0:54:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.93,0:54:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的手铐解下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take his shackles off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.68,0:54:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以回避一下 里奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please excuse us, Mr. Ulrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.95,0:54:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯先生也回避一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take Mr. James with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.66,0:55:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认得这些人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you recognize these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.87,0:55:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女儿会认得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because your daughter will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.17,0:55:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是她的养父母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're her new parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.87,0:55:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.24,0:55:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派帕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.81,0:55:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她长大后会管这个人叫爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the man she'll grow up calling Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.58,0:55:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你采取点措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.05,0:55:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.92,0:55:26.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定我把地址放在这里某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sure I have her address around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.92,0:55:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个聪明人 艾姆斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a smart man, Mr. Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.70,0:55:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按我的游戏规则玩 皆大欢喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play my game, we both go home happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.57,0:55:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死我妻子的人也在这监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who killed my wife is in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.10,0:55:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道当面对质时 他会怎么答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what he'll say when I ask him why he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.74,0:55:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不照照镜子 问问镜中人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you look in a mirror? Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.18,0:55:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的派帕 她的爸爸杀死了她的妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Piper. It must be hard growing up with that knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.15,0:55:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背负着这一耻辱长大可真不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That your father killed your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.47,0:56:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要一头怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.58,0:56:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好 现在你有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.20,0:56:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的眼睛像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.87,0:56:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像她妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.84,0:56:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练 为什么你没有编号的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you wear a number, Coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.31,0:56:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我不是囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm not a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.58,0:56:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年前我获准假释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I qualified for parole three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.18,0:57:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我走到大门时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got as far as the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.42,0:57:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们称它为"某某综合症"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a name for it, something-or-other syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.26,0:57:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实是 我来这里后 这世界已经改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The simple fact is, the world's changed since I've been in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.56,0:57:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个世界 我不认识 也不太想去认识 但这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know it. Don't much want to. But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.40,0:57:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我熟悉这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.94,0:57:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们用什么借口关你进来? - 多得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did they send you away for? - Oh, plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.27,0:57:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但无一成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.44,0:57:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么被关进来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what do we owe the pleasure of your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.58,0:57:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀了我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.45,0:57:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.68,0:57:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是条狠汉 但你不会杀你妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a hard man, but you ain't no wife killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.79,0:57:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.99,0:57:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've met my share.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.86,0:57:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你 你看着你女儿的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you, the way you looked at her...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.06,0:57:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你杀了她妈妈 你不可能那样子望着她 所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't do that if you'd killed her mother. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.70,0:57:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你在胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.44,0:57:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.65,0:58:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我说轩尼诗杀了我妻子 然后嫁祸给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you say if I told you Hennessey had my wife killed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.22,0:58:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我关在这里 成为她的弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and me framed for it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.32,0:58:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会怎么看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she could bring me in here to be her Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.79,0:58:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这么胡扯的话 你会怎么看?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you say to that bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.96,0:58:18.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫苏西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name was Suzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.70,0:58:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道 我有这么一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was always headed here. Always knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.34,0:58:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.68,0:58:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我新生活的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was my chance at something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.09,0:58:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那婊子从我身边夺走了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that bitch took her away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.87,0:59:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"并使你的日子在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"That thy days may be long upon the land...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.21,0:59:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华你神所赐的地上得以长久"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which the Lord thy... Giveth thee."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.60,0:59:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你不可...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thou shalt not...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.87,0:59:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kill."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得休息一下 睡个觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take a break. Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.59,0:59:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好 管事婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay, Lists.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.90,1:00:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神去比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentration for the race.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要的是集中精神 你得去休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentration, that's what you need. Gotta get your rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.24,1:00:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.05,1:00:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟我还是要休息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take that break after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.16,1:00:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good call.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.52,1:00:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙完全不会打磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy can't grind for shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.45,1:00:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.89,1:01:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.83,1:01:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.21,1:01:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀死我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.22,1:01:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now, maybe I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎那婊子是不是要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care if the queen bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.35,1:01:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留着你比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wants to save you for the track.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.92,1:01:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有一个对兄弟会不敬的人能活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody disrespects the Brotherhood and lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.80,1:01:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.90,1:01:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要砸掉你的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to take your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.70,1:02:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.76,1:03:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗指使我做的 里奇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey made me do it. Ulrich...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.40,1:03:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有里奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ulrich too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.27,1:03:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.87,1:03:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我做什么我都愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.08,1:03:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.75,1:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操你妈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.38,1:03:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小伙 冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, now, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.35,1:03:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留着力气比赛吧 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's save that for the track, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.21,1:04:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.82,1:04:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.39,1:04:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们究竟在这里建造什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell were they building in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.73,1:04:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.81,1:04:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.72,1:04:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.18,1:05:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看死亡飞车第二场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the next installment of Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.71,1:05:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二场即将开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stage 2 begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.15,1:05:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林 柯尔特和西亚德都丧生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grimm, Colt and Siad are gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.52,1:05:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下六名车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six remaining drivers alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.72,1:05:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,14K\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14K.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.26,1:05:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派晨高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pachenko.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.13,1:05:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riggins.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.29,1:05:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carson.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.00,1:05:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三场赢家大炮乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-time winner Machine Gun Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.10,1:05:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,排最后一名的是他的死敌 弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And starting from the back of the grid, his archrival, Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.50,1:05:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是我们最后一次看到 弗兰克斯坦比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be the last time we see Frankenstein race.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.77,1:05:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再赢一场他就重获到自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one more victory and he wins his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.98,1:05:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是乔不先把他干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Joe doesn't kill him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.08,1:05:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超过5000万观众已经订购节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over 50 million viewers have already subscribed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.28,1:05:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别错过这场史诗之战 现在就订购第二场吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't miss this epic battle. Subscribe to Stage 2, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.78,1:06:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.32,1:06:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.36,1:06:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.90,1:06:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.10,1:06:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他落在后面 他压根没打算比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dropping back. He's not even trying to race.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.91,1:06:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出隧道前 就可以把事情说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be done by the time we leave the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是杀了老弗兰克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill the old Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.59,1:06:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.92,1:06:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就到隧道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tunnel comes up fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.42,1:06:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得那个凝固汽油弹筒的事故吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what happened to the napalm canister?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.93,1:06:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果发生在你身上 那可真令人惋惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a real shame for that to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.14,1:07:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是杀了老弗兰克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill the old Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.87,1:07:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我毁坏了他的尾部武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sabotaged his rear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.54,1:07:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.71,1:07:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她答应会签署释放令 那是我重获新生的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she'd sign my release papers. It's my life back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.92,1:07:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我 我也会杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have killed him, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.28,1:07:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有杀他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.79,1:07:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不肯放弃 我只是要保证他不能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't quit. I just wanted to make sure he didn't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.89,1:07:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么轩尼诗要那样做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would Hennessey want that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.72,1:07:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把弗兰克留着这里 比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To keep Frank here, racing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.73,1:07:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那昨天呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.26,1:07:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要我拖后你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wanted me to set you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.77,1:07:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以她也不给我赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm not supposed to win, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.60,1:07:38.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是为了让比赛更刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make it exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.54,1:07:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道的就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.67,1:07:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道的就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.35,1:07:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.63,1:08:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 全速前进!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Just come on through!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.52,1:08:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.97,1:08:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟着派晨高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going after Pachenko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.24,1:09:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有宝剑和护盾 拿防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sword and shield ahead. Take defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.54,1:09:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.11,1:09:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's someone I need to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.15,1:09:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑在前头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out in front.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.85,1:09:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还打算射谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you going to shoot at?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.22,1:09:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.46,1:09:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你拿防御的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to take defense!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.54,1:10:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的装备太猛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's too heavily armored!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.09,1:10:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.22,1:10:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.47,1:11:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在比赛 你不能往后倒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a race. You don't go backwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.09,1:11:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能下车的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.63,1:11:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗指使的 轩尼诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Hennessey. Hennessey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.14,1:11:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 下一个是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. She's next.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.55,1:11:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 弗兰克下了车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. Frank's out of his car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.36,1:11:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.79,1:11:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他下车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stepped out of his car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.19,1:11:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 看到了 我要武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I see him. I need guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.16,1:11:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 前面50码有宝剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Sword coming up in 50 yards.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.67,1:12:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.14,1:12:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是谁拿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody must have grabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.77,1:12:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思 有人拿了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, somebody grabbed it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.30,1:12:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥儿 我以为它是亮着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man. I thought it was lit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.14,1:12:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思啊你以为?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, you thought?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.11,1:12:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我的车滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, get the fuck out of my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.04,1:12:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.28,1:12:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 从我的车滚出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, get the fuck out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.70,1:12:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的 拜托 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hell, no! Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.23,1:12:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们...等等 等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we got... Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.94,1:12:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 还没轮到我 这不是我的职责!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait! It ain't my turn! It's not what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.54,1:12:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.28,1:12:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小伙 别让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let me down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.69,1:13:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出动无畏舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the Dreadnought.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.60,1:13:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.15,1:13:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.35,1:13:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我知道他们在建造什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess we know what she was building now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.36,1:13:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激活武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.14,1:13:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.25,1:14:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练 有什么办法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.68,1:14:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你只可以硬熬过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have to tough it out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.28,1:14:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收视率上去后 轩尼诗会把它收回去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey will take it off after she's pumped up the ratings.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.26,1:14:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.31,1:14:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那东西到底要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is that thing going?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.39,1:15:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.58,1:16:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.26,1:16:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管事婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lists.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.40,1:16:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Receiving.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.46,1:16:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你帮我接到另外那台车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to patch me through to another car.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.67,1:16:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.87,1:16:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.11,1:16:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.34,1:16:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是弗兰克 你想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Frank. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.28,1:16:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们玩场进攻游戏如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about we play a little offense?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.72,1:16:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你知道自己在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.60,1:18:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才像娱乐节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.67,1:18:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.81,1:18:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦! 弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein! Frankenstein! Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.05,1:18:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein! Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.02,1:18:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦 弗兰克斯坦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein! Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.27,1:18:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丑八怪 反应挺快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice reflexes there, lgor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.11,1:18:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛车手的敏捷反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Race car reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.74,1:18:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟 你看起来很困惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look lost, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.05,1:18:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.28,1:19:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉到你跟弗兰克很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this feeling that you and Frank are close.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.09,1:19:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常的像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real close.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.76,1:19:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是那种怪口音 你们听起来都很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That weird accent. You even kind of sound alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.39,1:19:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想 如果你出了意外会怎么样呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering, what if you got in a accident?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.80,1:19:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克会不会因此不能参赛呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would that throw Frank off his game a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.50,1:19:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我表示怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt it,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.34,1:19:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是一个丧心病狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sick, fucked-up guy that he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.04,1:19:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能他只是想杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might just want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.31,1:19:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.55,1:19:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我猜我一会能见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I guess I'll see him later.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.05,1:19:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.63,1:19:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.61,1:20:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 冒昧问一句 我们打算怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, with all respect, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.35,1:20:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 我们要干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to kill him, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.15,1:20:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我杀了弗兰克斯坦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to kill Frankenstein?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.85,1:20:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.49,1:20:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦死不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein can't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.79,1:20:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟 他只是一副面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, he's just a mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.72,1:20:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚是死亡飞车的最后一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight is the final leg of the Death Race,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.19,1:20:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能会诞生新的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and perhaps a new champion will arise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.30,1:20:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五场比赛的赢家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A five times winner.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.83,1:20:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首个获得自由的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first man ever to gain his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.44,1:21:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界把你们交给我 因为你们不适合成为它的一份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world gave you to me because you were not fit to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.24,1:21:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不适合当丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were not fit to be husbands,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.61,1:21:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不适合当父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were not fit to be fathers,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.12,1:21:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和别人一起生活时会严重威胁到别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and were too dangerous to live with the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.99,1:21:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么狗屁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this shit, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.72,1:21:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但今晚你们比赛时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you race tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.29,1:21:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住全世界的目光都落在你们身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}know that the eyes of the world are upon you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.22,1:21:54.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住那个曾经拒绝过你们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And know that the very same world which rejected you
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.19,1:21:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的心跳呼吸都由你们掌握着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now lives and breathes with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.93,1:22:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因你们的勇气而感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it draws inspiration from your courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.57,1:22:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有人赢过五场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is ever gonna win five races.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.60,1:22:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 好好比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So race well...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.91,1:22:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能走出这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody is ever getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.74,1:22:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记着 我把你们都奉为我的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and know that I consider you all my heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.82,1:22:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你看些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.09,1:22:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀不死我的 杀不死我的 我是他妈的的死神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't kill me. Can't kill me. I'm the fucking Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.64,1:22:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以烧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can burn me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.00,1:22:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以射我 但你们就是他妈的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can shoot me. But you can't motherfucking...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.31,1:22:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.92,1:23:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮手 管事婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner, Lists.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.06,1:23:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我加个半加仑的储备油箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Hennessey's inspectors care
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.63,1:23:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗的检查员会在意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we had a haIf gallon reserve tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.83,1:23:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加个半加仑的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another haIf gallon?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.57,1:23:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的油箱已经能装35加仑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a fuel tank that holds 35 gallons.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.10,1:23:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要多那半加仑干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell you want another haIf gallon for?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.07,1:23:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.77,1:23:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give the man what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.24,1:23:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.29,1:23:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.14,1:23:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够大胆的 来踩场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real brave, coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.28,1:23:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要赢得比赛 我要离开这粪坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to win this race, 'Cause I want out of this shithole.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.25,1:24:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经赢了三场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already won three races.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.75,1:24:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再赢两场我就能在迈阿密抽雪茄王了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two more, and I'm smoking Cohibas in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.36,1:24:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克可以考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank might want to think about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.26,1:24:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.80,1:24:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.54,1:24:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许才会轮到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe it's his turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.60,1:24:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他在想这是另一条出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's thinking it's the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.35,1:24:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 滚出我的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here on out, you stay the fuck out of my pit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.22,1:24:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.10,1:24:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你应该跟弗兰克谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking you and Frank should have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.00,1:24:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎收看死亡飞车最后一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the final installment of Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.91,1:24:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7位车手丧生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven men dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.51,1:24:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西亚德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Siad,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.91,1:24:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grimm,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.54,1:25:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯尔特 派晨高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colt, Pachenko,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.05,1:25:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carson,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.38,1:25:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riggins
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.55,1:25:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和14K都丧身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and 14K are all dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.85,1:25:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下弗兰克斯坦和大炮乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Frankenstein and Machine Gun Joe survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.29,1:25:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克 为了他的自由而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank, racing for his freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.79,1:25:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔 不惜一切阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe, doing anything to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.86,1:25:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强强对抗 绝不怜惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mano y mano, and there will be no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.30,1:25:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚 只有一个能活着走下赛道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, only one man will walk off this track alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.24,1:25:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收视已破7000万记录 加入一齐来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A record 70 million are already watching. Join them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.97,1:25:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就订购最终决赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subscribe to the final stage now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.55,1:25:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 能当你的领航真是荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor to navigate for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.48,1:25:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做... 省省吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call me... Save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.22,1:25:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间去认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't have time to get acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.62,1:25:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are those?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.22,1:25:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄式7号火箭推进式榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Model 7 Russian states armory RPG's.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.00,1:25:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可穿透装甲 自动上弹 精确射程达到1000码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armor-piercing, self-arming, accurate to 1,000 yards.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.73,1:25:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.41,1:26:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner, step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.95,1:26:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这对你来说是点鼓励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe you could use a little inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.69,1:26:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的释放令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your release papers.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.29,1:26:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经签好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're already signed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.53,1:26:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做的就是活着走下赛道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is walk off that track alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.90,1:26:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 也要赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, and win, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.58,1:26:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你真的赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you do win,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.68,1:26:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能考虑留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to think about staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.12,1:26:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续做弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.79,1:26:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.72,1:26:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.52,1:26:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看得出你的恳求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.69,1:26:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要自由来干什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do with your freedom?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.20,1:27:00.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到你女儿身边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.00,1:27:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.30,1:27:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.87,1:27:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能带给她最好的将来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are you really the best future she could possibly have?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.94,1:27:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的是做父亲的料吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you really daddy material?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.18,1:27:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者事实上 你更适合做其他的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or deep down, are you something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.19,1:27:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你认定赛道才是你的归属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you decided that out there on that track is where you belong,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.36,1:27:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那将会是我见过最无私的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would be the most unselfish act of love I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.53,1:27:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just something to think about.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.41,1:28:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.04,1:28:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small modification.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.01,1:28:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轩尼诗告诉我 当你快要赢时 我要阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Hennessey telIs me if you're going to win, I'm supposed to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.22,1:28:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.89,1:28:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们没什么优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like the odds are stacked against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.76,1:28:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那尽你全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then do what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.03,1:28:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.41,1:28:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生们 这场应该很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.04,1:29:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的宝剑亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lit sword up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.64,1:29:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关闭它 长官?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deactivate that. Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.61,1:29:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.51,1:29:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch it back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.81,1:29:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器可以用了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons are up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.88,1:29:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.59,1:29:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.49,1:29:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的护盾亮了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lit shield up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.23,1:29:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.33,1:29:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.40,1:29:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是轩尼诗关掉了 那婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hennessey must have deactivated it. Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.48,1:30:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我点烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's party time.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.82,1:30:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练 我们得弄点火药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach, we gotta get the firepower.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.15,1:30:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑了半圈 什么都不亮给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing lit for a haIf lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.02,1:30:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们支持不了多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't last that long!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.86,1:31:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把墓碑卸下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the tombstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.56,1:31:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.93,1:31:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照做!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.07,1:31:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我指示 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my mark. Three,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.68,1:31:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.98,1:31:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.18,1:31:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.99,1:31:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.52,1:31:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白痴 我怎么会连续中两次计呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That shit don't work twice, playboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.13,1:32:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.47,1:32:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再过四分之一圈有护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lit shield in quarter lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.53,1:32:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到吗?再过四分之一圈有护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear that? Lit shield in the quarter lap.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.09,1:32:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他紧紧追着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming up fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.02,1:32:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给护盾他们 让观众找点乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them get the shield. Keep the viewers interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.40,1:32:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贱人 他拿到护盾了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch! He got the shield!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.84,1:32:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装上炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arm the explosive.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.28,1:32:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.25,1:32:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Frankenfreak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.59,1:32:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有件玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This villager's got a pitchfork,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.42,1:33:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正直冲向你的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's headed straight up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.15,1:33:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.96,1:33:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 耶 弗兰克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Yeah, Frank!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.56,1:33:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跑出赛道外了 他们在逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're off the track. They're escaping.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.53,1:33:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们朝桥那边逃去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're headed for the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.10,1:33:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关闭他们的武器 打开电击开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their weapons. Hit the kill switches.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.37,1:33:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 7000万观众 他们都在看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy million viewers, ma'am. They're all watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.78,1:33:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把直播关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the webcast down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.91,1:33:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.05,1:33:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把电脑关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fucking computers down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.52,1:34:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去 出去 出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out! Get out! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.29,1:34:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去 出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.62,1:34:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去 出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.30,1:34:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呦 弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.26,1:34:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真庆幸我们谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good we had that little talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.40,1:34:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们给那婊子演了场好戏 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gave that bitch a good show, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.25,1:34:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.18,1:34:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊杂种 跟我玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, cocksucker, fuck with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.85,1:34:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看最后谁更惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll see who shits on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.09,1:34:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某人现在一定气疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's mad right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.03,1:34:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能搞我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody fucks with my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.46,1:34:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.93,1:34:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直升机行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the choppers in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.77,1:34:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快 起飞 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Off the ground. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.95,1:35:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真名是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's your real name?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.59,1:35:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间跟你闲聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have the time for small talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.76,1:35:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想知道我跟谁一起逃命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just want to know who I'm riding with.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.63,1:35:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰森·艾姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jensen Ames.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.77,1:35:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像... 像那款车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like... Like the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.70,1:35:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像那款车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.34,1:35:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 杰森·艾姆斯 我希望你已经心里有数了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Jensen Ames, I hope you got a plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.68,1:35:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为看起来 我们并不能逃很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it's not like we're going to get very far.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.85,1:35:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.71,1:35:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.84,1:35:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是好时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now would be a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice modification.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.03,1:36:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那额外的半加仑油缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That extra haIf gallon reserve tank
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.20,1:36:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能伴你度过难关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should see you through to the finish.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.84,1:36:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bon voyage, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.74,1:36:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 直升机有图像了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choppers have a visual, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.19,1:37:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运 乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.47,1:37:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我接到飞行员那里 我要马上跟他通话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me a pilot. I need to talk to a pilot right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.28,1:37:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 接通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.51,1:37:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯着弗兰克斯坦 别跟丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with Frankenstein! Don't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.79,1:37:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定要这样做吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you're up for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.29,1:37:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.46,1:37:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我欠弗兰克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe it to Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.86,1:37:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外 轩尼诗已经签了我的释放令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, Hennessey already gave me my release papers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.66,1:37:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们必须让我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have to let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.53,1:39:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 他们截住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've stopped him, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.04,1:39:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手放在我们能见到的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands where we can see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.37,1:39:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.57,1:39:44.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我重复 把手放在我们能见到的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, keep your hands where we can see them!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.45,1:39:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.89,1:39:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 丑八怪 圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lgor. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.43,1:40:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们一起离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.79,1:40:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.43,1:40:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有这样的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact you have duds like these
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.03,1:40:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会令人怀疑你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might make someone question your...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.56,1:40:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的品味?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My taste?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.70,1:40:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 可以这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. So to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.07,1:40:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你有什么打算 但我要去迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about you, but I'm headed to Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.24,1:40:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈阿密不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miami's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.77,1:40:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们那边见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.01,1:40:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回我的宝贝女儿后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I got my baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.12,1:40:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜没有机会收拾轩尼诗那婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame I didn't get to take care of that bitch Hennessey.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.82,1:41:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That is a shame.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.43,1:41:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗兰克斯坦被抓回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein has been retrieved.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.14,1:41:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人 收视率创新高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, ma'am, ratings are off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.27,1:41:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贺礼和贺辞已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gifts and congratulations are already coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.44,1:41:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win again.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.55,1:41:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里奇先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ulrich,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.22,1:41:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总会赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always win.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.35,1:41:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.43,1:41:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真爱这游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.09,1:42:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(六个月后 2000英里外)
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.95,1:42:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(墨西哥 圣罗萨利亚)
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.66,1:42:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要修好这破车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we had to fix this car?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.40,1:42:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要修多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times we gonna keep doing this, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.73,1:42:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这车不能起动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This car is not gonna start.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.31,1:42:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.84,1:42:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你要我做个老实人 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you want me to live the life of an honest man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.78,1:42:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你最好适应这种生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. You better get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.12,1:42:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 丑八怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lgor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.81,1:42:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们有个伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think we got a little company.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.32,1:43:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么那么久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.42,1:43:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明我的释放令时遇到些麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had trouble getting my release papers approved.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.69,1:43:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我想让你见个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here. There's someone I want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.80,1:43:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.53,1:43:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多美的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has beautiful eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.33,1:43:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像她妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're her mother's.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.84,1:43:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车哪儿弄来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you get the rims?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.74,1:43:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打牌赢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won it. Card game.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.07,1:43:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.17,1:43:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.54,1:43:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这引擎有多大马力?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many horsepower's in this engine?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.31,1:43:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,500匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five hundred.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.85,1:43:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.35,1:44:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经有人问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone once asked me,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.15,1:44:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能不能为我女儿带来美好的将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did I think I was the best future for my little girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.09,1:44:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这问题我想了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I've thought about for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.26,1:44:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后我想通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.06,1:44:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界上没有人是完美的 我当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one in this world is perfect. Heaven knows I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.30,1:44:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我爱她胜于任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I love her more than anyone else possibly could.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.27,1:44:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到最后 这才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the end, that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.71,1:44:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我新生活的希望 更美好的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my chance at something else. Something better.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.01,1:44:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我绝不会放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's no way I'm letting go of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.95,1:50:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 杂种 跟我玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, cocksucker, fuck with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.09,1:50:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看最后谁更惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll see who shits on the sidewalk.
